      "step_id": 1,
      "title": "Run LiCellMo measurement",
      "instruction": "Place the cells in the LiCellMo instrument; the biosensors will continuously sample the extracellular fluid and record glucose and lactate concentrations in 1‑minute cycles throughout the experiment.",
